            "level": {
              "value": 8
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You attempt to snag the foe before they run away.\n\nAttempt an Athletics check against the higher of the triggering creature's Athletics DC or Fortitude DC.\n\n- **Critical Success:** You disrupt the movement.\n- **Success:** You are able to slow the triggering creature down. It takes a \u201310-foot circumstance penalty to its Speed for the rest of its triggering movement. This penalty might cause the triggering creature's movement to end immediately based on its affected Speed.\n- **Failure:** As success, but the creature instead takes a \u20135-foot circumstance penalty to its Speed."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
